https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101331","id":2587921781,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aQI11","user":{"login":"DrCanvas","id":65372494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzcyNDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65372494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas","html_url":"https://github.com/DrCanvas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DrCanvas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T18:41:26Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T18:41:26Z","body":"Alternatively, we could display arrays/dictionaries more efficiently by merging property names and values into a single line. The preview could be slightly grayed out and displayed only when there's enough space. We could add options in editor settings to toggle these previews on/off and adjust their threshold.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f93447b-b794-42a8-99d0-d054955ec421)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2587921781/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592907327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101331#issuecomment-2592907327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101331","id":2592907327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ajKA_","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T13:49:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T13:49:12Z","body":"> Alternatively, we could display arrays/dictionaries more efficiently by merging property names and values into a single line. The preview could be slightly grayed out and displayed only when there's enough space. We could add options in editor settings to toggle these previews on/off and adjust their threshold.\r\n> \r\n> ![image](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/65372494/402655499-0f93447b-b794-42a8-99d0-d054955ec421.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..vhiSzCXxVXvH8pa1Lyek0DpwfSApb2-6t21q3OpBGjM)\r\n\r\nI like the changing the preview color o mark a clearer distinction between the two but mixing the property name and value is clearly a no for me. This would make it too much different from all others property editors and would dilute information and make it harder to read.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2592907327/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]